<div class="article">
    <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p>

    <h1>Ideas worth exploring.</h1>

    <p class="article-description">
        A space for learning, thinking, and putting ideas into words.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h2>Why this website exists</h2>

    <p>
        The world is full of things worth understanding.
        This website is a place to explore them, one idea at a time.
    </p>

    <p>
        From technology and science to history, business, and
        the unexpected things in between, these pages document
        ideas worth investigating and lessons worth sharing.
    </p>

    <h2>The approach</h2>

    <p>
        Learn something, understand it well enough to explain it,
        and share what you've discovered. The goal isn't to know
        everything, but to remain curious.
    </p>
